## DSP Implementation Standards

### Testing Framework (Catch2)

```cpp
#include <catch2/catch_test_macros.hpp>
#include "FilterCore.h"

TEST_CASE("FilterCore processes audio correctly", "[dsp]") {
    FilterCore filter;
    filter.reset();
    filter.setFrequency(1000.0f, 44100.0f);

    // Impulse response test
    float impulse[128] = {1.0f};
    float output[128];

    for (int i = 0; i < 128; ++i)
        output[i] = filter.processSample(impulse[i]);

    REQUIRE(output[0] != 0.0f);
    REQUIRE(std::abs(output[127]) < 0.01f);
}
```

